# PART 17: TROUBLESHOOTING GUIDE

## 17.1 Quick Fixes for Common Problems

### Problem: No green or red pipes visible

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Run simulation (⚡ Simulate)
- [ ] Check "Include boundaries with unassigned areas"
- [ ] Verify you have multiple zones
- [ ] Check link type filters (all checked?)
- [ ] Look for any boundaries at all in dashboard

### Problem: Animation shows no dots

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Run simulation (⚡ Simulate)
- [ ] Verify you have open boundaries (green pipes)
- [ ] Check that flows aren't zero
- [ ] Try toggling animation off/on

### Problem: Can't click pipes

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Check "Interactive Links Mode" is ON
- [ ] Are you clicking on a boundary pipe? (only boundaries toggle)
- [ ] Try hovering first to confirm pipe is detected

### Problem: Table empty

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Run simulation (⚡ Simulate)
- [ ] Check Nodes/Links selection
- [ ] Try different attribute
- [ ] Verify data exists in dashboard

### Problem: Colormap not appearing

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Select "Nodes" (not Links)
- [ ] Run simulation (⚡ Simulate)
- [ ] Choose attribute with data
- [ ] Check legend popup didn't open behind main window

### Problem: Export to Excel fails

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Install openpyxl: `pip install openpyxl`
- [ ] Try CSV export instead
- [ ] Check write permissions for folder

### Problem: Application slow

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Turn off animation
- [ ] Hide zone polygons
- [ ] Close table panel
- [ ] Remove colormap
- [ ] Clear filters

### Problem: Boundaries not updating

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Did you click Apply? (automatic selections need apply)
- [ ] For interactive: Is mode ON?
- [ ] Check dashboard to confirm changes

### Problem: Can't see zone polygons

**Quick fix checklist:**
- [ ] Check "Show zone boundaries" is checked
- [ ] Are you in animation? (polygons auto-hide during animation)
- [ ] Stop animation to restore

